WEBVTT

00:11:55.829 --> 00:12:01.162
I believe in the power of my own
resilience and ability to survive

00:12:01.787 --> 00:12:06.246
and persist. And I think that's what the
parents give us if they love us well

00:12:06.246 --> 00:12:08.954
and they love us. Right. And
if we don't get that,

00:12:09.246 --> 00:12:11.704
we have to find it ourselves
and the world.

00:12:12.537 --> 00:12:18.246
I think that as I was rereading Wilde
and as I watch the movie again, too,

00:12:18.246 --> 00:12:19.746
which was really wonderful.

00:12:21.829 --> 00:12:28.621
I also got the sense that that your
journey was one of finding out if you

00:12:28.621 --> 00:12:34.704
could rely on yourself, if you could take
care of yourself, pretty extreme way.